       "text": "I haven't entered this order. **Amlodipine 50 mg is 5 times the usual maximum daily dose.**\n\n- **Usual adult dosing:** 2.5\u201310 mg by mouth once daily. 10 mg/day is the maximum.\n- **Risk at 50 mg:** It's in the overdose range and could cause severe low blood pressure, reflex tachycardia, and possibly shock. Because amlodipine has a long half-life (about 30\u201350 hours), the effects would last a long time.\n\nThis looks like it could be a typo for **5 mg** (a common starting dose) or a mix-up with another drug. Can you confirm which you meant?\n\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily**\n2. **Amlodipine 10 mg PO once daily**\n3. **Something else.** If 50 mg is truly intended, please tell me the clinical reason. I'd also strongly recommend checking with pharmacy before it's entered.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order right away."
